# Keep the public Vercel deployment limited to what is actually meant to be
# served over the web (the assets/ site content). Everything below is
# internal project-control material, local server source, or local-only
# runtime data that must never be publicly reachable at a guessable URL,
# even though it stays tracked in Git for the team.
docs
scripts
data

# The client working-model demo (enquiry/admin/dashboard) is explicitly a
# local-only artifact — its own file headers state "not deployed anywhere" —
# because its backend (node:sqlite + a long-running http server) cannot run
# on Vercel's serverless/static platform. Shipping its static HTML shell here
# would present real-looking enquiry/admin forms that silently cannot work.
assets/mockups/working/demo
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
CLAUDE.md
START-LINA-PROTOTYPE.bat
Lina-Project-Control-Pack-v1.0.zip
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vercelignore
